{"reviews":[{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-0","r":2.0,"t":"cute but powerless","x":"HONEST REVIEW: I like the sleek style and color scheme.  I loved the ease of use and the hidden storage compartment within the tool(definitely keep that component. However what I didn't like is the weak power in combination with the low grit file. I think a couple of levels up would give the quick and neat professional work we are all hoping for. I had to work way to hard and long to file and I have rather thin nails. I still didn't get the desired filing. Also, the power switch needs to be a bi","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-1","r":5.0,"t":"PEN-SIZED, POWERFUL AND QUIET, PERFECT FOR TRAVEL","x":"[[VIDEOID:10403a9f9d8fea591f66a75f1fa6ea65]] I super loved this cute pen-sized touchbeauty micro nail drill that comes with 3 attachment. It is super handy and what I like more about this is their is built-in compartment, convenient for storing all the attachements. So, it's easy for you to bring anywhere. It is cordless and powered by 1 AAA battery. I definitely will highly recommend this to everyone to buy. Worth the money easy to use and it is very good quality.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-2","r":3.0,"t":"Mixed feelings","x":"It's good for real nails, however if you're using it for acrylics or the poly gel nails to do fills it is not powerful enough kind of disappointed but it is good for your real nails","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-3","r":2.0,"t":"Not very powerful","x":"I like this because it's compact.  I can carry it in my purse in case of a nail emergency.  However, even with a brand new battery, it's not very powerful.  The slightest amount of pressure causes it to stop spinning.  It was cheap, so I won't return, but I would not buy another one.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-4","r":2.0,"t":"Weak","x":"I'm disabled, horrible hands, and this is very easy to use. Unfortunately, it's weak. Ugh! Not ever trying again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-5","r":1.0,"t":"Do get it .\u2639\ufe0f","x":"Oh boy you get what you pay for . This don't even take polish off.\ud83d\ude14\ud83d\ude14","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-6","r":4.0,"t":"Great for fixes\u2026","x":"So I put the batteries in (used dollar tree ones) and it was eh okay. I decided before I would make a review that I should try better batteries. So I bought Amazon brand batteries and it actually made it work better than using cheap ones! I do recommend this product, especially if you\u2019re the type who picks at their nails, skin around nails, and is always using a file. This is one of the best handheld file I have used and for the price, worth it! Just don\u2019t get it if you want to do a full set of ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-7","r":1.0,"t":"Completely Useless","x":"POWERLESS. Even with a brand new battery this didn't have the power to file a nail. Sanding bit is pressed into the polisher and stops if you do more than barely touch your nails, Any pressure at all and it stops working. DO NOT waste your money, buy an emery board instead, it is 10,000% more effective and far less frustrating.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-8","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it","x":"I am really enjoying using this product. At first I couldn't get the tips to stay in the end of the item, they kept just falling out when I turned it on. Then I finally figured out that you have to push them in extra hard and they will stay securely. My nails never looked better!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-9","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"This product has a very poor quality, it's like a toy, not a real tool. When the drill touched the finger or nail, it stops to work, because the motor is not strong enough to continue working. So the product doesn't work and is totally useless. Don't waste your money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-10","r":4.0,"t":"TOUCH BEAUTY Micro Nail Drill","x":"Item as pictured. Its lightweight and great for travel! Requires 1 AAA battery and good to go! Comes with 3 attachments for quick and easy touch ups. Have used it briefly and it worked without issue. I would recommend. Its an inexpensive and portable nail drill!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-11","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work at all","x":"What a joke. I ended up throwing this straight into the trash I was so upset. No power at all. I touched it too my fingernail and it would even move. Useless. I would had returned it but I tossed the packaging before I even tried it.  Waste of money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-12","r":1.0,"t":"Crappg dont buy save your money!!!!","x":"So cheap you cant use it. It wobbles when it spins and doesnt file as soon as you touch your nail with it it stops spinning even with the slightest touch it doesnt file not enough power or something just crappy quality a waiste of my money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-13","r":5.0,"t":"This product is easy to use!","x":"This product is easy to use and for a great price. It jus takes double A batteries to operate. The grip is comfortable and I will definitely be putting it to good use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-14","r":3.0,"t":"It's adequate for travel","x":"It's adequate  during travel.  When I use some cheap brand battery , it turned very slow and not workable.  However,  when I put in rechargeable battery it work OK.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-15","r":1.0,"t":"Bad","x":"This product isn't great at all the material , quality and the way it was put together Bad. I wouldn't recommend even tho it was only 5 dollars but not worth it ..","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-16","r":3.0,"t":"Lacks power","x":"I love how compact this file is and that it comes with multiple tips, but it lacks power. The moment I actually pushed it to the nail, the tip stopped turning.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-17","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"Item did not have enough power. Would stop rotating once I touched the file to my nails. Cheap product, not even worth the few dollars I paid!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-18","r":5.0,"t":"Very good. Recommended","x":"this product is awesome. this was very precise and easy to use.I took my bushy eyebrows to manecured arches in less than 20 mins.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-19","r":3.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"Price was very fair, but disappointed in how well it works.  Takes long time to file nails and i would not purchase item again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-20","r":1.0,"t":"Suuuuuuuper weak","x":"Not terrible if all you want to do is a light buff to add some shine. Motor not nearly strong enough to even file nail ends.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-21","r":1.0,"t":"worthless","x":"Terrible product, just threw it away after i used once, the drummel stops with any amount of pressure.  Even a feather touch","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-22","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy useless.","x":"This product is horrible for adults it might work for kids but it's not a good product.  It does not do what it advertises.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-23","r":1.0,"t":"Crappy","x":"This was cheapest filer I have ever gotten. It does not take the SNS off at all. You\u2019re lucky if it buffs it out a little.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07MMMKW9W-24","r":1.0,"t":"Worthless","x":"This didn't work AT ALL! The minute it touched your nail, it stopped rotating. I would give it ZERO stars if I could.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the drill too weak or powerless, often stopping with even slight pressure on the nail.","cites":[1,4,5,8,10,12,13]},{"text":"Reviewers praise its compact, pen-sized, lightweight design that is easy to use and convenient for travel.","cites":[2,4,5,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note that performance depends heavily on battery quality, working better with stronger or rechargeable batteries.","cites":[7,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it works well for natural nails and quick touch-ups but is not powerful enough for acrylics or gel fills.","cites":[3,9,11]},{"text":"The built-in storage compartment for attachments is a commonly appreciated feature.","cites":[1,2]}]},"qa":[]}